      "post_subject": "Lasers from Laserglow?",
      "content_md": "> **JohnFP:** and linewidth of .1nm.\n\nWell, in all fairness, it did say <0.1nm \n\nOK, I saw the prices on the site. The 100mW 473nm laser with the best power stability (which sounds good to me) is $3,589. At that price, I would be expecting something pretty good. A Melles-Griot 58-BLD-605 doing well in excess of 400mW is currently on the market for $6,000.",
